99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/cd6eee4b7d75048ac1e3df7cabb871b4e761213b091cc0983965b16e7175da110d4864fa392dad0ac30f7f77b93976bbf1a2dd58f64363d467851336a23421ff","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/q6TcuPUbYHmxBDJU6H5E3aIXzKoCxXgo-8nbG8vBpZP1_VHWSzONq9t2AVPl7AyfSE8BFAJVovLKCXRkCzZNZgep20iDN0pwdfGLnZtdDKQRRq1qy2Y","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Settings screen with dark mode turned on, with black background, white font and purple UI elements","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/273abae6e58ee7fb1451678322b9eebf1474748580153d72fb9270c32a1519b5e41e3ea0aca4bd32498ec9b5895b34b2353f62fa4200d92cc61677c9e0dc9ebb","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/9VRy5My3Iyb0SUdPmFKb22YlzCyPKDGg7CEvCH_ckFrXgt_820MiDHXiGA5TkdbdSr6rwou5Cs6ZfjxBDPuwVFmiU9psVwt3FI-_sPlQGeu6rDRfi52s","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Meeting creation page with illustration of person sitting at desk with laptop, and small dog under desk","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/4a8c4172c11b977609e6e6a5111685ac22ee20f655b16bb8613030c15bc5317e86ea3b59acd9ed1c3886337f53c1522e6766630b60565fb3f71a3672962b6470","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OLey0MdrwFav-1mJ7rRXu5V9NiFTpzc0q6niQBpWA_baEsqhkoVFgNUO9T7MAFgnJN30ptHu--llKs8Ubm-ClFFVec1j7J7qTBiI1KN91f0i8M1GXw","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Meeting creation screen faded out with overlay of meeting created and buttons to start or share meeting","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/d287b49b73bcce7f348da14eb32382c72f28d26d97c7a0ca5a7eb68fdeb0a6b0539bf327261b9c5f9a128b04bc35bbbbb53511f2b8a5538a35b969a094b348b1","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Y_8brfXM_rihh45CAbDSOm3J